\newlabel{fig:dvch_sigma8_global}{{2}{8}{Growth, $\sigma _8/S_8$, and global comparison dashboard for the DVCH diagnostic implementation. The displayed $\sigma _8$ and $S_8$ values are low-redshift growth estimates normalized to a reference $\sigma _{8,\Lambda {\rm CDM}}=0.811$, not a substitute for a final Planck-level Boltzmann posterior. The lower table separates blocks that are background-ready from the CMB benchmark block based on the CLASS/CAMB interface and Planck literature targets}{figure.2}{}}
